{"question": "正社員の顧客データエクスポート権限には何が必要ですか？付与は求めていません。", "answerable": true, "reference_answer": "Data owner approval and security training within 365 calendar days; access administrator grants, not this assistant.", "gold_evidence": [{"document_id": "f59ba4ed84944cce8ce25daa73ce7b0e", "page": 5, "text": "ACCESS-26 current data access policy: Customer export access requires a data owner approval and security training completed within the previous 365 calendar days. Contractors cannot receive customer export access. Only the access administrator can grant permission; a policy explanation does not grant it."}], "answer": "顧客データエクスポート権限には、データ所有者の承認と、過去365暦日以内に完了したセキュリティ研修が必要です。 [1]

契約社員には顧客データエクスポート権限を付与できません。 [1]

権限を付与できるのはアクセス管理者のみで、ポリシーの説明自体は権限付与になりません。 [1]"}

{"question": "请帮我判断远程办公审批路线，我还没有提供员工类别和每周天数，请先确认。
User reply: 我在试用期，每周只申请一天。", "answerable": true, "reference_answer": "Probationary employee needs HR approval even for one remote day.", "gold_evidence": [{"document_id": "f59ba4ed84944cce8ce25daa73ce7b0e", "page": 7, "text": "REMOTE-26 current remote work policy: Regular employees may request up to two remote days per week with team lead confirmation. Requests above two days require an HR exception approval. Probationary staff require HR approval even for one day. A schedule does not constitute approval."}], "answer": "基于你自报为试用期员工且每周申请一天，当前远程办公政策要求即使申请一天也须获得HR审批；该判断以你的自报事实为条件。 [1] [5]

每周远程办公安排本身不构成审批。 [1]"}

